desc: Fix the transposed letters
category: manual
par: 2
hint1: Two keystrokes can swap adjacent characters
hint2: Delete one character and put it back after the next
solution: xp
note: x deletes the character under the cursor; p puts it back after the next one —
note: the classic two-key transpose fix.
--- START ---
hte cat
--- GOAL ---
the cat
--- END ---
